  m_text: 'Controls:

    - Arrow Keys to move

    - Z to attack

    - X to jump

    -
    Q to pause game


    Throw off all pirates into the sea to win!

    You''ll
    die if you fall into the sea.


    Hit lots of enemies in quick succession and
    avoid getting hit to keep getting stronger! Don''t be idle!


    If your pulse
    is DYING, getting hit will kill you.'
